<section background-color="heading" id="bbs030" image-layout="blank"><card-template-instructions>Inverse-ground closing, the heading color as the card fill: thanks, next steps and contact block on the left, one image region on the right for the brand's own graphic.</card-template-instructions><grid spacing="none"><grid-item colspan="36" vertical-align="center" id="VRx3_rz2ln"><h1>Thank you</h1><p font-size="lg">Decisions from today go to the regional managers on Friday; the plan is reviewed again in September.</p><spacer size="24pt"></spacer><p font-size="sm">Northwind Supply · plan@northwind.example · northwind.example</p></grid-item><grid-item colspan="24" padding="0" id="rY_ftKMl2T"><img meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1440,&quot;height&quot;:2560,&quot;has_transparency&quot;:false}" alt="Abstract photograph of folded matte paper planes overlapping in soft directional light, deep shadow across the lower half, no text, no objects, quiet composition" image-style="plain-photo" background="true" source="image.ai-generated" saved-media-id="i89ttcayfyzkwzk" src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/gammatemplatelibrary/g_hdwa21xzz00ppa2/template-assets/960c6e2d7efcb05173244d9e8419bc99/u3htz6QJMAmSl4WGdNsiv.jpg"></grid-item></grid></section>